000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     TRPTMR.
000400 AUTHOR.         N W REGIMBAL.
000600 DATE-WRITTEN.   DEC 05, 1980.
000700*REMARKS.        THIS PROGRAM PRINTS A REPORT SHOWING ALL
000800*                CORP-CODES AND ITEM STATUS PER CODE.
000900*
001000*                ON JULY 13, 1982, THE BUFFER AREA MSTORERM
001100*                WAS CHANGED IN PREPARATION FOR THE NEW DATA
001200*                BASE CHANGE. B.J.P.
001300*
001400*                ON JULY 9, 1984;  ADDED THE STOREROOM MAINTENANCE
001500*                SWITCH TO THE PRINTOUT.  THIS WAS REQUESTED
001600*                BECAUSE AN "X" IS NOT THE ONLY ENTRY FOR THIS
001700*                FIELD ANYMORE.   -B. WINTER.
001800*
001900*       ADDED INTERNATIONAL DATE ROUTINE "TDATECHK" ON
002000*       MAY 21, 1985.    V.W.D.
002100*
002200*                ON NOVEMBER 25, 1986 - EXPANDED THE SIZE OF THE
002300*                AVERAGE COST FIELD FROM S9(6)V9(4) TO S9(11)V9(4).
002400*                ALSO ADD COPYLIB AND EXPANDED OTHER COST/PRICE
002500*                FIELDS.           D.A. PLUM.
002600*
002700*                ON FEB 5,1987 - THE FOLLOWING HAS BEEN ADDED
002800*                  OR CHANGED:
002900*                  1. ADDED CALL TO TRSCREEN FOR FRONT END REPORT
003000*                     OPTION.
003100*                  2. ADDED FULL DESCRIPTION OPTION.
003200*                  3. ADDED HEADER PAGE TO THE REPORT USING SUB-
003300*                     PROGRAM 'THDPRT2'.  (DHDR37.PUB)
003400*                  4. PRINT COMPRESSION FEATURE.
003500*                  5. NON-HP LOGIC
003600*                  6. REPLACED CALL TO DBEXPLAIN WITH CALL TO
003700*                     TBLOWUP.
003800*                  7. ADDED CALL TO CDESC TO GET FULL DESCRIPTION
003900*                     IF REQUESTED.
004000*                  8. CHANGED TO USE COPYLIB FOR ALL DATA SET
004100*                     BUFFER DESCRIPTIONS
004200*                  9. CHANGED COPY STATEMENTS TO "IN COPYCSIS".
004300*
004400*
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C   ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C  SEPT 04, 1996   CA YODER
      *C   RE-COMPILED PROGRAM TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C  07/31/1997   CA YODER     REQ #95-015
      *C    MODIFIED PROGRAM TO ACCEPT AND USE THE NEW OPTIONS ADDED
      *C    TO THE MATERIALS CONTROL REPORTS.
      *C    NOTE:  THIS PROGRAM NOW USES COPYLIB MEMBERS FOR MOST OF
      *C           ITS PROCESSING LOGIC.  TO SEE ALL OF THE MEMBERS,
      *C           LOOK IN COPYLIB FOR THE FILES THAT START WITH THE
      *C           PREFIX "MTLS".
      *C
004500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
